{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"markdown-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Markdown Snippets","description":"Tables, links, images, code blocks, task lists, front matter and README sections.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"Markdown","path":"snippets/markdown.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/markdown.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Link\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"link\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[${1:text}](${2:https://})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A link\"\n  },\n  \"Image\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"img\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"![${1:alt}](${2:path})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An image\"\n  },\n  \"Code block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"code\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"```${1:js}\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"```\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A fenced code block\"\n  },\n  \"Table\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"table\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"| ${1:Column} | ${2:Column} |\",\n      \"| --- | --- |\",\n      \"| ${3:cell} | ${4:cell} |\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A table\"\n  },\n  \"Task list\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"task\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"- [ ] ${1:todo}\",\n      \"- [x] ${2:done}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A task list\"\n  },\n  \"Front matter\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fm\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"---\",\n      \"title: ${1:Title}\",\n      \"date: ${2:2026-01-01}\",\n      \"tags: [${3}]\",\n      \"---\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"YAML front matter\"\n  },\n  \"Collapsible\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"details\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<details>\",\n      \"<summary>${1:Summary}</summary>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"\",\n      \"</details>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A details block\"\n  },\n  \"Badge\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"badge\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[![${1:label}](${2:https://img.shields.io/badge/label-ok-green})](${5:link})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A badge\"\n  },\n  \"Blockquote\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"quote\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"> ${1:text}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A quote\"\n  },\n  \"README skeleton\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"readme\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"# ${1:Project}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"${2:One line about it.}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"## Install\",\n      \"\",\n      \"```\",\n      \"${3:npm install}\",\n      \"```\",\n      \"\",\n      \"## Usage\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"\",\n      \"## License\",\n      \"\",\n      \"${4:MIT}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A README\"\n  },\n  \"Changelog entry\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"chg\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"## ${1:1.0.0} - ${2:2026-01-01}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"### Added\",\n      \"- $0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A changelog entry\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Markdown Snippets\n\nTables, links, images, code blocks, task lists, front matter and README sections.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 11 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Markdown | `link` | A link |\n| Markdown | `img` | An image |\n| Markdown | `code` | A fenced code block |\n| Markdown | `table` | A table |\n| Markdown | `task` | A task list |\n| Markdown | `fm` | YAML front matter |\n| Markdown | `details` | A details block |\n| Markdown | `badge` | A badge |\n| Markdown | `quote` | A quote |\n| Markdown | `readme` | A README |\n| Markdown | `chg` | A changelog entry |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}